<title>POLAND: Irena plans no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Irena plans no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish glass maker Huta Szkla Gospodarczego Irena SA plans no dividend for 1996 and wants to earmark most of last year's 6.5-million-zloty net for reserve capital, the firm said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the firm's general shareholders meeting would vote on setting aside 6.47 million zlotys from the 1996 net for reserve capital and the rest for various bonuses.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
